  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "seg-0001",
      "index": 0,
      "startMs": 300,
      "endMs": 4905,
      "text": "哎雪玲，你最近在忙啥？好久没见你发朋友圈了。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0002",
      "index": 1,
      "startMs": 5355,
      "endMs": 10468,
      "text": "我开了个 Substack！专门写华语和台湾音乐的中文翻译。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0003",
      "index": 2,
      "startMs": 10918,
      "endMs": 14415,
      "text": "哇，有点东西啊。怎么突然想搞这个？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0004",
      "index": 3,
      "startMs": 14865,
      "endMs": 26330,
      "text": "就是想在下班之后，做点原创的、有意义的东西。我这个人吧，就是活到老学到老，特别喜欢学习新东西，也想认真写作和研究。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0005",
      "index": 4,
      "startMs": 26780,
      "endMs": 29155,
      "text": "懂。那你平时都写啥？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0006",
      "index": 5,
      "startMs": 29605,
      "endMs": 39084,
      "text": "主要是关于华语和台湾音乐的翻译，还有我个人的一些思考。我会聊中国和日本的哲学、灵性、美学之类的。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0007",
      "index": 6,
      "startMs": 39534,
      "endMs": 43538,
      "text": "听起来很文艺啊。你之前不是学写小说的吗？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0008",
      "index": 7,
      "startMs": 43988,
      "endMs": 51818,
      "text": "对啊，我更习惯当个 creative writer，写 essay 或者 journalism 还在摸索中。但我在努力！",
      "speaker": "B",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0009",
      "index": 8,
      "startMs": 52268,
      "endMs": 56132,
      "text": "那你这个 blog 有定位吗？比如走什么 niche？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0010",
      "index": 9,
      "startMs": 56582,
      "endMs": 64612,
      "text": "说实话，我不太想刻意搞什么 niche。就顺其自然，围绕东亚研究这个主题。走着瞧呗！",
      "speaker": "B",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0011",
      "index": 10,
      "startMs": 65062,
      "endMs": 68888,
      "text": "哈哈，松弛感拉满。那你平时喜欢啥？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0012",
      "index": 11,
      "startMs": 69338,
      "endMs": 76234,
      "text": "山、茶、独处。我跟道家隐士、和尚、古代诗人有种深深的共鸣。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0013",
      "index": 12,
      "startMs": 76684,
      "endMs": 80696,
      "text": "绝了，听起来很适合你。那我蹲一个订阅！",
      "speaker": "A",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    }
  ],
